Third-party software
--------------------
PreCutter depends on the following projects, installed separately via pip
(requirements.txt) and not bundled in this repository:

- FastAPI (MIT)
- Uvicorn (BSD-3-Clause)
- python-multipart (Apache-2.0)
- NumPy (BSD-3-Clause)
- faster-whisper (MIT)
- PyAV (BSD-3-Clause)
- PyTorch / torchaudio (BSD-3-Clause)
- httpx (BSD-3-Clause), pytest (MIT) for tests

FFmpeg / ffprobe are required at runtime and must be installed by the user.
They are invoked as external programs and are not distributed with PreCutter.
FFmpeg is licensed under the LGPL/GPL depending on how it was built.

Speech recognition models (Whisper via faster-whisper) and optional local
vision/language models are downloaded by the user and remain under their own
licenses.